values
  ('Universe of Emily', 'patreon', 'UniverseofEmily', 'https://www.patreon.com/UniverseofEmily/about', NULL, 'cosplay', 'Colorado, USA', 'csv', 78, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: active Patreon, tiers Community/Maker/Super Supporter (prices not shown). ACTIVITY: 187 posts. SOCIALS: Instagram @universeofemily. FOLLOWERS: not published on any public page - left blank deliberately. EMAIL: not obtainable (Patreon obfuscates). SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/UniverseofEmily/about. FIT: sells patterns and STL files to makers - Spotlightly digital products plus tips would consolidate this. OPENER: I saw the Maker tier on your Patreon - the pattern and STL side of what you do looks like it deserves its own storefront rather than a tier.', 'identified'),
  ('JuTsukino', 'patreon', 'JuTsukino', 'https://www.patreon.com/jutsukino/about', NULL, 'cosplay', 'London, United Kingdom', 'csv', 84, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile and Linktree. MONETIZATION: 145 members (3 paid), 7 tiers from $1 Tip Jar to $100. Also Gumroad, Ko-fi, Amazon wishlist. ACTIVITY: multi-platform, active. SOCIALS: IG @jtstudio.cosplayart, TikTok @ju_tsukino, Twitch, YouTube, Twitter. LINK PAGE: https://linktr.ee/jutsukino. Previously Brazil. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: Linktree shows an Email section but no address in plain text. SOURCES: https://www.patreon.com/jutsukino/about ; https://linktr.ee/jutsukino. FIT: strongest profile found - already runs tips, memberships, digital sales and a wishlist across five separate services. OPENER: You are running a tip jar, memberships, Gumroad and a wishlist across five different services - that is exactly the sprawl Spotlightly is built to collapse into one page.', 'identified'),
  ('Mugiwara Cosplay', 'patreon', 'mugiwaracosplay', 'https://www.patreon.com/mugiwaracosplay', NULL, 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 72, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: 901 Patreon members, tiers from $1.50/month. SOCIALS: Twitter, Instagram (handles not displayed). FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/mugiwaracosplay. FIT: sizeable paying membership already - subscriptions plus paid posts map directly. OPENER: 901 people already pay to follow your builds - that audience would carry straight over to a page you own.', 'identified'),
  ('Jacqueline Goehner', 'patreon', 'JacquelineGoehner', 'https://www.patreon.com/JacquelineGoehner/about', NULL, 'cosplay', 'Los Angeles, CA, USA', 'csv', 70, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. ADULT CONTENT - page states cosplay, photography, sexy content, tutorials, streams. MONETIZATION: multiple tiers including physical rewards at $5/$7/$10. SOCIALS: YouTube, Snapchat, Discord. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/JacquelineGoehner/about. FIT: mixed SFW/adult catalogue and physical rewards - Spotlightly supports adult creator_type plus merch and messaging. REVIEW FLAG: confirm adult-content policy before outreach. OPENER: You are shipping physical rewards out of Patreon tiers - that is a merch store fighting to get out.', 'identified'),
  ('It''s Nikki Nicole', 'patreon', 'itsnikkinicole', 'https://www.patreon.com/itsnikkinicole/about', NULL, 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 71, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: tiers from $1/month, weekly hi-res photosets and fortnightly video. ACTIVITY: latest post 5 days before verification. SOCIALS: Twitter, Tumblr, Instagram, YouTube, Twitch, Facebook. NICHE: drag and cosplay. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/itsnikkinicole/about. FIT: high-cadence photoset publishing suits paid posts and subscriptions. OPENER: Weekly photosets and a fortnightly video is a real publishing schedule - it should be running on something you own.', 'identified'),
  ('Ludella Hahn', 'patreon', 'LudellaHahn', 'https://www.patreon.com/LudellaHahn', NULL, 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 68, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. ADULT CONTENT - cosplay/pinup photosets and video. MONETIZATION: 100 paid members, tiers from $5/month. SOCIALS: Instagram and Twitter @ludellahahn. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/LudellaHahn. REVIEW FLAG: adult content - confirm policy before outreach. FIT: established paid base, photoset-led. OPENER: A hundred paying members for photosets is a solid base to move somewhere you set the rules.', 'identified'),
  ('Wynter Cosplay', 'patreon', 'WynterCosplay', 'https://www.patreon.com/WynterCosplay', NULL, 'cosplay', 'Netherlands (originally Switzerland)', 'csv', 74, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: tiers from $2.50/month, Generous Wolf tier includes physical rewards. WEBSITE: wyntercosplay.com (stated on page, not separately fetched). CONTENT: tutorials plus lewd-but-not-nude. COMMUNITY: patron Discord, monthly game nights. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/WynterCosplay. FIT: already runs own domain plus community - messaging and subscriptions fit. OPENER: You already run your own site and a patron Discord - Spotlightly would put the paid side on the same domain as the rest.', 'identified'),
  ('Akemikun', 'patreon', 'AkemikunCosplay', 'https://www.patreon.com/AkemikunCosplay/about', NULL, 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 69, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: benefits from $1/month. ACTIVITY: latest post dated July 18, within a week of verification. SKILLS stated: sewing, patterning, 3D printing, prop making, armour, wig work. Describes self as full-time cosplayer/content creator. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/AkemikunCosplay/about. FIT: full-time self-managed creator - the core Spotlightly persona. OPENER: Going full-time on costume work means the platform fees matter - Spotlightly takes none of your earnings.', 'identified'),
  ('sugarc0maa', 'patreon', 'sugarc0maa', 'https://www.patreon.com/sugarc0maa/about', NULL, 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 76, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. Creator first name Ivana per page. MONETIZATION: 243 members (18 paid), monthly photosets with patron voting, sells patterns/tutorials and cosplay advice. ACTIVITY: 629 posts. SOCIALS: @sugarc0maa on Instagram, Twitter, TikTok, Twitch. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/sugarc0maa/about. FIT: sells services plus digital goods plus memberships - three Spotlightly surfaces at once. OPENER: Patterns, advice sessions and monthly sets are three different products - they would sit better on one page than three tiers.', 'identified'),
  ('Alicornia', 'patreon', 'alicornia', 'https://www.patreon.com/alicornia/about', NULL, 'cosplay', 'Canada', 'csv', 75, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. Creator first name Emma per page. MONETIZATION: 96 members (24 paid). ACTIVITY: 1,003 posts - very high cadence. SOCIALS: IG/Twitter/TikTok @alicorniacos, Twitch ustrinasparks. LINK PAGE: alicornia.carrd.co. Page says small city in Canada. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/alicornia/about. FIT: 25% paid conversion is unusually strong for the size. OPENER: A quarter of your members pay - that conversion is worth building on a page you control.', 'identified'),
  ('Titi_cos_', 'patreon', 'Titi_cos', 'https://www.patreon.com/Titi_cos', NULL, 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 67, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: tiers from $7.50/month plus individual post purchase at $35 - already sells one-off paid content. ACTIVITY: latest post 5 days before verification. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/Titi_cos. FIT: per-post purchasing is exactly Spotlightly paid posts. OPENER: You already sell individual sets at $35 - that is a paid post, and it does not need to live inside a membership tier.', 'identified'),
  ('Ugami', 'patreon', 'ugamicosplay', 'https://www.patreon.com/ugamicosplay', NULL, 'cosplay', 'Los Angeles, CA, USA', 'csv', 66, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: benefits from $5/month, takes prop commissions. SKILLS: 3D modelling, sewing, wig styling, foam, resin, lighting. Page says Filipino-American cosplayer from LA. ACTIVITY: latest post dated May 22 - roughly two months before verification, slower cadence. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/ugamicosplay. FIT: commissions plus memberships. REVIEW FLAG: check cadence before prioritising. OPENER: Prop commissions and memberships are two businesses - they could run off one page.', 'identified'),
