  ('Jinxy Dragon', 'patreon', 'jinxydragoncosplay', 'https://www.patreon.com/jinxydragoncosplay/about', NULL, 'cosplay', 'United Kingdom', 'csv', 44, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: 34 members but only 1 paid - weak conversion. ACTIVITY: 163 posts. Amazon wishlist link on page (amzn.eu/6koaEsT). FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/jinxydragoncosplay/about. FIT: wishlist plus props, but monetisation is barely started. LOW PRIORITY - included for completeness, filter out if you want proven earners only. OPENER: The wishlist is doing more work than the tiers right now.', 'identified'),
  ('Mazur tattoo', 'patreon', 'Mazurtattoo', 'https://www.patreon.com/Mazurtattoo', NULL, 'tattoo', NULL, 'csv', 79, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: 1,052 members, tiers from $10/month - one of the largest verified memberships in this list. CONTENT: drawing and tattoo tutorials. SOCIALS: Instagram @mazurtattoo. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/Mazurtattoo. FIT: education-led tattoo artist - digital products plus subscriptions. OPENER: A thousand people paying for your tutorials is a course business, not a tier list.', 'identified'),
