  ('GRAVEDOGG', 'patreon', 'Gravedog', 'https://www.patreon.com/Gravedog', NULL, 'tattoo', 'United Kingdom', 'csv', 74, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: tiers from $2/month, $40+ tier takes requests (commissions). ACTIVITY: latest post 2 days before verification - very current. CONTENT: illustration, comics, tattoo designs and finished tattoos. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/Gravedog. FIT: commissions plus art packs plus tattoo work. OPENER: Taking requests at the top tier is a commission queue - it deserves proper tooling.', 'identified'),
