  ('GetFitwithCorey', 'patreon', 'getfitwithcorey', 'https://www.patreon.com/getfitwithcorey', NULL, 'fitness', 'New Orleans, LA, USA', 'csv', 71, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: tiers from $15/month covering in-person classes, at-home videos and personal training. ACTIVITY: page states workout videos posted weekly. LOCATION: business address published on page - 2901 General Degaulle Dr, New Orleans LA 70114. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/getfitwithcorey. FIT: hybrid in-person and digital - messaging plus subscriptions plus live. OPENER: Running classes in person and online from one membership is hard on Patreon - it is what Spotlightly is shaped for.', 'identified'),
