  ('Gothbynight', 'patreon', 'gothbynight', 'https://www.patreon.com/gothbynight', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 63, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching both the profile and the about page. MONETIZATION: 96 members but only 9 paid, tiers from $4/month - weak conversion against a large archive. ACTIVITY: 582 posts. CONTENT: artistic photography in gothic, fantasy, vintage and futuristic styles; indoor, outdoor and studio. Page renders in French. SOCIALS: Instagram @gothbynight. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCES: https://www.patreon.com/gothbynight ; https://www.patreon.com/gothbynight/about. FIT: photoset-led alternative aesthetic - paid posts. OPENER: Nearly 600 posts of work and nine people paying - the archive is worth more than the tiers make it.', 'identified'),
  ('DeLa Doll', 'other', 'deladoll', 'http://dela-doll.com/', NULL, 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 66, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the creator''s own website. CONTENT: cosplay, makeup tutorials, blogging (media commentary, reviews, creator spotlights). MONETIZATION: own Shopify store at deladoll.myshopify.com plus a Kickstarter campaign for acrylic charms - already sells physical product and has run crowdfunding. ACTIVITY: latest post dated April 16 2026. LOCATION: not shown. CONTACT ROUTE VERIFIED: business contact form at http://dela-doll.com/contact, which states "Please use this form to contact me with requests, business inquiries, general questions" - a legitimate published business contact method, but a form not an email, so the outreach flow cannot send to it. CONTACT ROUTE VERIFIED: "Request Consultation" business enquiry form at https://scottlaidler.com/contact; the page also carries an email link protected by Cloudflare, so an address exists but is not retrievable. Legitimate business contact method, not an email. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: http://dela-doll.com/. FIT: writing plus cosplay plus a merch line across a blog, a Shopify store and Kickstarter - three services Spotlightly consolidates. REVIEW FLAG: no email found, needs a contact route before outreach. OPENER: A blog, a Shopify store and a Kickstarter is three platforms for one audience.', 'identified'),
  ('Scott Laidler', 'other', 'scottlaidlercoaching', 'https://scottlaidler.com/', NULL, 'fitness', 'United Kingdom', 'csv', 70, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the coach''s own website. MONETIZATION: online personal training at $235/month or $597/quarter - the highest-ticket offer verified in this list. CREDENTIALS stated on page: Psychology BSc, CIMSPA registered, 15 years experience, 10,000+ coaching hours. Also runs the Healthy Ambition Podcast. SOCIALS: Instagram @scottlaidlercoaching, YouTube, LinkedIn. Serves clients in the US, UK and 54 countries. CONTACT ROUTE VERIFIED: "Request Consultation" business enquiry form at https://scottlaidler.com/contact; the page also carries an email link protected by Cloudflare, so an address exists but is not retrievable. Legitimate business contact method, not an email. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://scottlaidler.com/. REVIEW FLAG: trades under Health Forever LTD (Co. No. 10073449) - an individual coach operating through a limited company rather than a hobbyist. FIT: high-ticket coaching needs messaging and subscriptions more than paid posts. OPENER: At $235 a month your clients are buying access to you - that deserves better than email threads.', 'identified'),
  ('April Hunter', 'patreon', 'aprilhunter', 'https://www.patreon.com/aprilhunter', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 69, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: tiers from $1/month; also sells candles, soap and bath bombs via Etsy shop AprilsScentSations. WEBSITE: AprilHunterBlog.com (stated on page, not separately fetched). CONTENT: essays, cosplay, pinup and fitness modelling, pro wrestling history. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/aprilhunter. FIT: writing plus modelling plus a physical product line - merch, subscriptions and paid posts. OPENER: The Etsy shop and the writing are the same brand living in two places.', 'identified'),
  ('FLASHnMODELS', 'patreon', 'FLASHnMODELS', 'https://www.patreon.com/FLASHnMODELS', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 57, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: 28 paid members, tiers from $9/month. CONTENT: photoshoots, photography and editing. SOCIALS: Instagram @flashnmodels. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/FLASHnMODELS. REVIEW FLAG: photographer working with models rather than a self-branded model - check against your self-managed criterion. OPENER: Shoots and editing tutorials are separate products from the sets themselves.', 'identified'),
  ('TinyAngryCrafts', 'patreon', 'Tinyangrycrafts', 'https://www.patreon.com/Tinyangrycrafts', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 52, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: 24 members, tiers from $1/month. ACTIVITY: 70 posts. CONTENT: clothing and video from various fashion eras. SOCIALS: Instagram, YouTube. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/Tinyangrycrafts. REVIEW FLAG: early-stage monetisation. LOWER PRIORITY. OPENER: Historical clothing has a small, devoted audience - the kind that pays if you let them.', 'identified'),
  ('hoodied', 'patreon', 'hoodied', 'https://www.patreon.com/hoodied', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 50, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching profile. MONETIZATION: 110 members but only 1 paid - very weak conversion. TIERS: 1 through 5, from $1/month. CONTENT: handmade hoodies, sweaters and tunics inspired by comics and games; monthly patron-choice designs. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: not obtainable. SOURCE: https://www.patreon.com/hoodied. REVIEW FLAG: makes physical goods with almost no paid conversion - a merch storefront may suit better than memberships. LOWER PRIORITY. OPENER: Handmade clothing sells as a shop, not a subscription.', 'identified'),
  ('The Geeky Seamstress', 'other', 'thegeekyseamstress', 'https://thegeekyseamstress.com/costume-commissions/', 'thegeekyseamstress@gmail.com', 'cosplay', 'Texas, USA', 'csv', 86, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the creator''s own website. Creator first name Mindy per site. CONTACTABLE - email published in plain text by the creator on her own commissions page, for commission enquiries. MONETIZATION: costume commissions, Sailor Moon fuku from $500, Supers from $550, split payments over $250. Currently taking Sailor Moon commissions only, with a mailing list waitlist. ACTIVITY: latest blog post April 2025; 2025 contest wins including 1st Place Masters SoonerCon 2025; booked as cosplay guest, panellist and contest judge at Yellow City Comic Con and AggieCon. SOCIALS: Facebook, Twitter @geekyseamstress, Instagram @thegeekyseamstress, Tumblr, Pinterest. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCES: https://thegeekyseamstress.com/ ; https://thegeekyseamstress.com/costume-commissions/. FIT: highest-scoring prospect - self-managed, contactable, sells high-ticket commissions, runs a waitlist, and appears as a paid convention guest. Spotlightly would give her a commission queue, a wishlist and paid posts on one page. OPENER: You are running a commission waitlist off a mailing list and turning work away at $500 a costume - that queue deserves proper tooling.', 'identified'),
