  ('Lightning Cosplay', 'other', 'lightningcosplay', 'https://www.lightningcosplay.com/', NULL, 'cosplay', 'Germany', 'csv', 73, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the creator-owned website. Two cosplayers working together since 2012 per the site. MONETIZATION: own e-commerce shop selling handmade necklaces (EUR 49.90-59.90) and tutorial books (EUR 7.99-24.99), plus free downloads used as a funnel. Promotional work named on the page for Blizzard, Bethesda, Square Enix, CD Projekt and Digital Extremes. ACTIVITY: new wing pattern tutorial book released; Malevola cosplay files offered as a free download. SOCIALS: Instagram, Facebook, YouTube, TikTok, Twitter/X. EMAIL: not published in plain text. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.lightningcosplay.com/. REVIEW FLAG: a duo rather than a solo creator, and EU-based - confirm Stripe Connect coverage. FIT: sells both physical goods and digital tutorial books - merch plus digital products. OPENER: Tutorial books and necklaces are two very different products sharing one checkout - and free downloads are already doing the marketing.', 'identified'),
