  ('Ferngully Studio', 'other', 'ferngullystudio', 'https://www.ferngullystudio.com/', NULL, 'tattoo', 'Portland, OR, USA', 'csv', 57, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the studio-owned website. ARTISTS: Christina Hayes (fine line, botanical art, animal portraits; Instagram @christinahayes_tattoos) and Jess Jene (single needle shading; Instagram @tattoosbyjessiej, TikTok @jessjene). MONETIZATION: custom tattooing plus pre-drawn flash designs. EMAIL: not published in plain text. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.ferngullystudio.com/. REVIEW FLAG: a two-artist studio rather than a single self-managed creator, so it sits outside your stated preference - the two artists do each maintain their own Instagram presence and could be approached individually. FIT: flash sales and deposits would be new revenue rather than a migration. OPENER: Pre-drawn flash sells itself if people can buy it without a DM thread.', 'identified'),
  ('Gavin Maxwell', 'other', 'gavin.motion', 'https://www.gavin.fit/', 'info@gavin.fit', 'fitness', 'Los Angeles, CA, USA', 'csv', 79, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the coach-owned website. CONTACTABLE - info@gavin.fit published in plain text on his own site. MONETIZATION: personalised calisthenics programming, nutrition coaching, educational ebooks and workshops - a product ladder rather than a single service. Pricing not shown on the page. SOCIALS: Instagram @gavin.motion, YouTube @Gavin.Motion, TikTok @gavin.motion, plus a Facebook coaching group. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.gavin.fit/. FIT: sells ebooks and workshops alongside 1-to-1 coaching, so digital products, subscriptions and messaging all apply; the Facebook group suggests a community he does not own. OPENER: Ebooks, workshops and coaching are three products, and the community holding them together lives on Facebook.', 'identified'),
  ('Hendri Vermeer', 'other', 'hendrivermeer', 'https://onlinecalisthenicscoach.com/', 'info@HendriVermeer.com', 'fitness', NULL, 'csv', 77, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the coach-owned website. CONTACTABLE - info@HendriVermeer.com published in plain text. MONETIZATION: coaching at EUR 149.99/month plus separately sold training guides (wrist pain, beginner calisthenics, advanced skills). Search results describe 9 years as a military fitness instructor, but that detail was NOT on the page I fetched and is therefore not recorded as verified. SOCIALS: none shown on the page. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://onlinecalisthenicscoach.com/. FIT: recurring high-ticket coaching plus a guide catalogue - subscriptions and digital products together. OPENER: Guides sold once and coaching sold monthly are two businesses sharing one site.', 'identified'),
