  ('King Of Weighted Coaching', 'other', 'kingofweighted', 'https://www.kingofweighted.com/', 'support@kingofweighted.com', 'fitness', NULL, 'csv', 61, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the site. CONTACTABLE - support@kingofweighted.com published in plain text. MONETIZATION: weighted calisthenics coaching with movement corrections, load management and Zoom feedback; an online shop and book sales are referenced but pricing is not shown. SOCIALS: Instagram @kingofweighted, YouTube. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.kingofweighted.com/. REVIEW FLAG: the page identifies the operator as King Of Weighted GmbH - a registered company rather than a self-managed individual, which sits outside your stated preference. Search results attribute it to a named 4x national champion, but that was not on the page I fetched, so it is not recorded as verified. OPENER: Zoom feedback and a book catalogue are the two halves of a coaching business that could share one page.', 'identified'),
  ('Delilah DuBois', 'other', 'delilahdubois', 'https://delilahdubois.com/', NULL, 'alternative fashion', 'New York City and Dallas, TX, USA', 'csv', 68, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the performer-owned website. CREATES: burlesque performance, emcee work, pinup modelling, film and screen work, plus burlesque instruction and stage coaching. MONETIZATION: paid bookings for shows and residencies, teaching, and magazine/print publication. ACTIVITY: named Best Burlesque Performer 2025 by The Dallas Observer; Main Emcee for the Burlesque Hall of Fame Tournament of Tease in 2024 and 2025; featured in the film Last Hand slated for 2026. SOCIALS: none shown on the page. FOLLOWERS: not published. EMAIL: NOT RECORDED. The page displays filler@godaddy.com, which is a GoDaddy template placeholder rather than a real address - recording it would have put a fake contact into the pipeline. A genuine address must be found before any outreach. SOURCE: https://delilahdubois.com/. FIT: teaches, performs and models - messaging, paid posts and subscriptions all apply, and an unbranded template site suggests she would benefit from a proper page. OPENER: A performer with a Hall of Fame emcee slot deserves a site that is not still running the template placeholder text.', 'identified'),
  ('Spoon Makes', 'other', 'spoon_makes', 'https://www.spoonmakes.com/commission-request/', 'spoonmakes@gmail.com', 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 82, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the maker-owned website. CONTACTABLE - spoonmakes@gmail.com published in plain text on the commission page. MONETIZATION: prop and accessory commissions from USD 500+ per 12 inches for simple finished props, plus paid CAD modelling, custom Arduino code and circuitry, and painting services - genuinely technical work priced accordingly. COMMISSION STATUS: open for props, small accessories and individual armour pieces; not taking full costumes. Page identifies a sole proprietor. SOCIALS: Instagram @spoon_makes, Twitter @alinaspoon, Facebook, YouTube. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.spoonmakes.com/commission-request/. FIT: sells several distinct services at high ticket prices with an open/closed commission queue - commissions, digital products and messaging all apply. OPENER: An open-and-closed commission queue at $500 a piece is a booking system, not a contact form.', 'identified'),
  ('GiveWave Studios', 'other', 'givewavestudios', 'https://givewavestudios.com/commission-request/', 'givewave.studios@gmail.com', 'cosplay', 'Lowell, MA, USA', 'csv', 80, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the maker-owned website. CONTACTABLE - givewave.studios@gmail.com published in plain text. MONETIZATION: unusually complete - commission work on a 50% non-refundable deposit with the balance before shipping, plus a retail shop selling finished props, DIY kits, apparel, accessories and patterns, plus an Etsy presence. Business address published on the site: 47 Lee St, Lowell MA 01852. SOCIALS: Instagram, Facebook, Twitter, YouTube, Twitch, Etsy. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://givewavestudios.com/commission-request/. FIT: deposits, digital patterns, physical merch and streaming all in one operation - close to the full Spotlightly surface area. REVIEW FLAG: the page does not state whether this is one person or a team. OPENER: Deposits, kits, patterns and a Twitch channel are four revenue lines running on four different tools.', 'identified'),
  ('Printed Props Workshop', 'other', 'printedpropsworkshop', 'https://www.printed-props.com/', 'support@printed-props.com', 'cosplay', 'USA', 'csv', 74, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the maker-owned website. CONTACTABLE - support@printed-props.com published in plain text. MONETIZATION: commission service plus Etsy sales, with 450+ five-star reviews cited on the page. CREATES: custom 3D printed props - weapons, lightsaber hilts, blasters, armour, busts and dioramas. Site states handcrafted in the USA; no city given. SOCIALS: Instagram, YouTube, Facebook, X. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.printed-props.com/. REVIEW FLAG: the page reads first-person but does not confirm a sole operator. FIT: an established Etsy seller paying marketplace fees on every sale - a direct storefront is the obvious pitch. OPENER: 450 five-star reviews on Etsy is a reputation you rent rather than own.', 'identified'),
  ('Samantha Geist', 'other', 'dovahdesign', 'https://www.dovahdesign.com/custom-props/', NULL, 'cosplay', 'Central Florida, USA', 'csv', 71, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the maker-owned website. CREATES: fantasy props, cosplay and accessories with a stated focus on prop melee weapons, plus armour pieces. MONETIZATION: tiered commission pricing from USD 500 to 5000+, plus a retail shop. Operates as Dovah Design; page identifies her as an individual. SOCIALS: Instagram, TikTok @dovahdesign, Facebook, Pinterest. EMAIL: not published in plain text. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.dovahdesign.com/custom-props/. FIT: high-ticket commissions with published tiers plus a shop - commissions and merch. Needs a contact route found before outreach. OPENER: Published commission tiers from $500 to $5000 means you are already running a product ladder.', 'identified'),
  ('Champagne Corsets', 'other', 'champagnecorsets', 'https://champagnecorsets.com/', NULL, 'alternative fashion', NULL, 'csv', 66, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the maker-owned website. Page identifies Stella Socarras as the designer and maker. CREATES: bespoke one-of-a-kind couture corsetry, handcrafted to fit. MONETIZATION: custom corset commissions with a published pricing page at champagnecorsets.com/how-to-order/pricing/. SOCIALS: Instagram, TikTok @champagnecorsets, Facebook, LinkedIn. EMAIL: not published in plain text. LOCATION: not stated. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://champagnecorsets.com/. FIT: made-to-measure commissions in the alternative-fashion space - commissions, deposits and messaging. OPENER: Bespoke fitting work lives or dies on the back-and-forth with a client - that conversation deserves better than a contact form.', 'identified'),
  ('Andrew Tamayo', 'other', 'andrewtamayotat2s', 'https://www.andrewtamayotattoos.com/', NULL, 'tattoo', 'Phoenix, AZ, USA', 'csv', 63, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the artist-owned website. CREATES: American Traditional, mandala, fine line blackwork and floral tattoos. MONETIZATION: custom tattooing; the page states cash preferred with Visa/Mastercard accepted for an extra fee - a card-fee surcharge is a sign payment friction is a live problem for him. SOCIALS: Instagram @andrewtamayotat2s (note: differs from the domain name). EMAIL: not published in plain text. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.andrewtamayotattoos.com/. FIT: an individual artist with his own domain and no digital products yet - flash sales, deposits and a wishlist would all be new revenue. OPENER: Charging extra for card payments means the fees are already eating into the work.', 'identified'),
  ('bakka cosplay', 'other', 'bakkacosplay', 'https://www.bakkacosplay.com/commissions', 'contact@bakkaCosplay.com', 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 89, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the maker-owned website. Page identifies Florence Heyer, operating as bakka cosplay since 2005. CONTACTABLE - contact@bakkaCosplay.com published in plain text. MONETIZATION: wig, beard, prop and costume commissions with example pricing of roughly EUR 690-1270 and bookable commission slots. CRUCIALLY she already runs Patreon, Ko-fi, an Amazon wishlist, PayPal and Twitch alongside the commissions - six separate money surfaces, which is the exact sprawl Spotlightly exists to collapse. SOCIALS: Instagram, TikTok, Twitter, Facebook, Pinterest, Twitch, YouTube. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.bakkacosplay.com/commissions. REVIEW FLAG: EU-based (pricing in EUR) - confirm Stripe Connect coverage. FIT: the single best structural match found - memberships, tips, wishlist, commissions and live all already in use, just scattered. OPENER: Patreon, Ko-fi, a wishlist, PayPal and Twitch is five places for people to pay you, and a commission queue on top.', 'identified'),
  ('Ink By Faye', 'other', 'inkbyfaye', 'https://www.inkbyfaye.com/f-a-q/', 'inkbyfaye@gmail.com', 'tattoo', 'Concord, USA', 'csv', 84, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the artist-owned website. CONTACTABLE - inkbyfaye@gmail.com published in plain text. MONETIZATION: USD 50 non-refundable consultation fee, USD 150 non-refundable deposit, hourly rates for custom work with discounted rates for flash, one-hour minimum - a fully priced service ladder. DEMAND SIGNAL: page states she is booked two to four months in advance. STYLE: neo-traditional and whimsical - fantasy, creatures, pinups, Disney, Pixar, anime, video games. Works as an independent contractor, tattooing Saturdays. SOCIALS: Instagram @inkbyfaye. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.inkbyfaye.com/f-a-q/. FIT: already charges consultation fees and deposits by hand - Spotlightly would automate the deposit and let flash sell itself. OPENER: Booked four months out while collecting deposits manually is a scheduling problem, not a demand problem.', 'identified'),
  ('Christina Persika', 'other', 'persikadesignco', 'https://persikadesignco.com/tattoo-tickets', 'christina@persikadesignco.com', 'tattoo', 'Milwaukee, WI, USA', 'csv', 83, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the artist-owned website. CONTACTABLE - christina@persikadesignco.com published in plain text. Operating as Persika Design Co since 2016. MONETIZATION: sliding-scale tattoo tickets from USD 30 to 120 - an unusually thoughtful pricing model - plus art prints, greeting cards, notepads, stickers, gift cards, murals and custom design work. CREATES: watercolour, gouache, acrylic and digital art, tattoo flash, stationery and paper goods. SOCIALS: Instagram @persikadesignco, YouTube @christinapersika, Substack christinapersika, Facebook. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://persikadesignco.com/tattoo-tickets. FIT: sells physical goods, digital flash and services, and already writes on Substack - merch, digital products, paid posts and subscriptions all apply. OPENER: Sliding-scale tickets, prints and a Substack are three audiences that could be one.', 'identified'),
  ('Michelle Valadon', 'other', 'michellevaladondesign', 'https://michellevaladon.com/pages/custom', 'michelle@michellevaladon.com', 'alternative fashion', 'USA', 'csv', 78, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the maker-owned website. CONTACTABLE - michelle@michellevaladon.com published in plain text. CREATES: custom vintage-inspired and gothic jewellery - rings, necklaces, bracelets, earrings - plus modifications to existing pieces and bespoke one-of-a-kind commissions. MONETIZATION: e-commerce sales plus bespoke commissions taken on a 50% non-refundable deposit. Page reads first-person with a Meet the Designer section. SOCIALS: Instagram @michellevaladondesign, Facebook, Pinterest. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://michellevaladon.com/pages/custom. FIT: already takes deposits on bespoke work - commissions, merch and messaging. OPENER: Taking 50% deposits on bespoke pieces by email is a checkout waiting to happen.', 'identified'),
  ('Emma Rea', 'other', 'emma_rea_', 'https://www.emmarea.com/', 'enquiry@emmarea.com', 'alternative fashion', 'Melbourne, VIC, Australia', 'csv', 76, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the maker-owned website. CONTACTABLE - enquiry@emmarea.com published in plain text. CREATES: handmade alternative jewellery and accessories using gothic motifs - skulls, bones, ornate hearts, filigree, floral and celestial imagery. MONETIZATION: own e-commerce shop selling jewellery, garments, decor, accessories, olfactory products and gift cards. Business address published: 246 High Street, Northcote VIC 3070, Melbourne. SOCIALS: Instagram @emma_rea_, Facebook. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.emmarea.com/. REVIEW FLAG: Australia-based - confirm Stripe Connect coverage. FIT: a physical-product maker with a real storefront - merch, subscriptions and paid posts. OPENER: A shop with a street address and a jewellery bench is a brand people would follow if you gave them somewhere to do it.', 'identified'),
  ('Mo''s Parlor', 'other', 'blkgrlmagic91', 'https://www.mosparlor.com/commissions', 'mosparlor@gmail.com', 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 81, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the maker-owned website. CONTACTABLE - mosparlor@gmail.com published in plain text. Page refers to the owner as Mo, an individual maker. MONETIZATION: EVA foam commissions priced openly at USD 20/hr plus a 25% shop fee on a 15-hour base rate, with resin coating as a paid extra; turnaround stated as about 4 weeks standard and 6-12 weeks for large builds. ALSO sells downloadable PDF cosplay patterns - services and digital products side by side. SOCIALS: Instagram @blkgrlmagic91, Facebook MosparlorICS. LOCATION: NOT RECORDED - the only geographic hint on the page was a website design credit, which is not a stated business location, so the field is left blank rather than inferred. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.mosparlor.com/commissions. FIT: transparent hourly pricing plus a pattern catalogue - commissions, digital products and messaging all apply. OPENER: Publishing an hourly rate and a base-hours figure is unusually straight with people - that honesty deserves a checkout that matches.', 'identified'),
  ('Fineline Atelier', 'other', 'seraphim.fineline', 'https://www.finelineatelier.com/', 'FinelineAtelier.SEA@gmail.com', 'tattoo', 'Seattle, WA, USA', 'csv', 70, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the studio-owned website. CONTACTABLE - FinelineAtelier.SEA@gmail.com published in plain text. ARTIST NAMED: Seraphim. CREATES: custom botanical, nature-based and illustrative fine line tattoos, pet portraits, bookish pieces, dragons and Pacific Northwest themes. Located in a 125-year-old building in Seattle oldest neighbourhood per the page. Monthly flash and available designs are posted to Instagram. SOCIALS: Instagram @seraphim.fineline and @FinelineAtelier.Seattle, TikTok @fineline.atelier. EMAIL is the studio address rather than a personal one. MONETIZATION: not shown on the page - tattooing itself, no digital products or memberships found. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.finelineatelier.com/. REVIEW FLAG: a studio rather than a lone self-managed creator, though only one artist is named. FIT: flash currently sells via Instagram posts, which is exactly the friction a shop page removes. OPENER: Dropping monthly flash into Instagram means the designs disappear down the feed a week later.', 'identified'),
  ('NAVARO', 'other', 'bronavaro', 'https://bronavaro.com/', NULL, 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 65, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the site. CREATES: EVA foam cosplay templates, patterns, blueprints and Pepakura PDO files for armour and helmets. MONETIZATION: a pure digital-product business - templates sold individually from USD 5.99 to 39.99, with most featured items at 24.99-29.99 and discounts applied. SOCIALS: YouTube, Instagram, Facebook, Pinterest. EMAIL: not published in plain text. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://bronavaro.com/. REVIEW FLAG: the page does not state whether this is one person or a team, and gives no location - verify before outreach. FIT: sells nothing but digital files, so Spotlightly digital products would be a direct substitute rather than an addition. OPENER: A catalogue of paid templates is a storefront that could sit alongside the tutorials that sell them.', 'identified'),
  ('Kamui Cosplay', 'other', 'kamuicosplay', 'https://www.kamuicosplay.com/', NULL, 'cosplay', NULL, 'csv', 62, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the creator-owned website. Page identifies Svetlana and Benni, operating as Kamui Cosplay since 2011; Svetlana states cosplay became her full-time job. MONETIZATION: print books, digital PDF patterns, discount bundles and branded merchandise - a mature digital-plus-physical catalogue. SOCIALS: YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, X, Twitch. EMAIL: not published in plain text. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.kamuicosplay.com/. REVIEW FLAG: two people rather than a solo creator, and a long-established brand that is plausibly above your 250k band - treat as a considered approach rather than a cold pitch, and verify reach first. FIT: books, patterns and merch across several storefronts. OPENER: Books, patterns and merch have been building since 2011 - the question now is how much of that revenue the platforms keep.', 'identified'),
  ('Celeste Lai', 'substack', 'limbforest', 'https://limbforest.substack.com/', NULL, 'tattoo', NULL, 'csv', 77, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the Substack. Page names Celeste Lai (she/they), trading as Limbforest Tattoo. AUDIENCE: over 6,000 Substack subscribers stated on the page - the largest verified owned audience in this list, and squarely inside your 1k-250k band. MONETIZATION: the newsletter carries booking links when her tattoo books open, publishes available flash designs, and announces guest spots - it is the booking channel, not a side project. PAID TIER: not shown. SOCIALS: not shown on the page. EMAIL: not published. FOLLOWERS: 6,000+ is a SUBSCRIBER count, recorded here rather than in the followers column to keep that column strictly social-follower data. SOURCE: https://limbforest.substack.com/. FIT: already runs an owned email list as the booking mechanism - Spotlightly would add deposits, flash sales and a wishlist to an audience she already controls. OPENER: Six thousand people already opted in to hear when your books open - that list is the whole business.', 'identified'),
  ('Kat Lyons', 'substack', 'katlyyons', 'https://katlyyons.substack.com/', NULL, 'tattoo', 'Los Angeles, CA, USA', 'csv', 68, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the Substack. CREATES: tattoos, illustration and background art; custom work and flash pieces. Page states Los Angeles based and that the newsletter launched a year ago. SUBSCRIBER COUNT: not shown. PAID TIER: not shown. SOCIALS: not shown on the page. EMAIL: not published. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://katlyyons.substack.com/. REVIEW FLAG: no audience size and no contact route visible - verify reach before prioritising. FIT: sells flash and custom work across tattooing and illustration - two catalogues that could share one page. OPENER: Flash and illustration prints are the same audience buying two different things.', 'identified'),
  ('Onion''s Tattoo Newsletter', 'substack', 'molymoli', 'https://molymoli.substack.com/', NULL, 'tattoo', NULL, 'csv', 71, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the Substack. AUDIENCE: over 3,000 subscribers stated on the page - inside your target band. MONETIZATION: newsletter covers tattoo booking and new designs. PAID TIER: not shown. SOCIALS: not shown. EMAIL: not published. LOCATION: not shown. FOLLOWERS: 3,000+ is a SUBSCRIBER count, kept out of the followers column for the same reason as above. SOURCE: https://molymoli.substack.com/. REVIEW FLAG: the page does not give a real name or location - identify the artist before outreach. FIT: an owned list already used for bookings and design drops. OPENER: A mailing list for bookings and new designs is a shop that has not been given a checkout.', 'identified'),
  ('Brittany (KB Fit Britt)', 'other', 'kbfitbritt', 'https://www.kbfitbritt.com/coaching-program', 'info@kbfitbritt.com', 'fitness', 'Morro Bay, CA, USA', 'csv', 76, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the coach-owned website. CONTACTABLE - info@kbfitbritt.com published in plain text. Page identifies her as an individual. CREATES: online coaching in kettlebell sport technique, handstands, kettlebell fitness and total body mobility, plus done-for-you training programmes. MONETIZATION: pricing not shown on this page, but both bespoke coaching and packaged programmes are offered. SOCIALS: Instagram @kbfitbritt, YouTube @kbfitbritt, Facebook. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.kbfitbritt.com/coaching-program. FIT: a specialist coach selling both 1-to-1 access and pre-built programmes - subscriptions, digital products and messaging. OPENER: Done-for-you programmes and personal coaching are different products at different prices, and both need somewhere to live.', 'identified'),
  ('Ericka Darst (EDK Training)', 'other', 'edktrainingmn', 'https://www.edktraining.com/online-training', 'edktrainingmn@gmail.com', 'fitness', 'Minneapolis, MN, USA', 'csv', 74, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the coach-owned website. CONTACTABLE - edktrainingmn@gmail.com published in plain text. MONETIZATION: the most transparently priced offer verified in this list - live remote coaching at USD 100 per session, ten-packs at 85 per 50-minute session or 55 per 30-minute session, and a custom four-week online strength programme at 325. Also sells digital downloads and runs small-group and in-person coaching. SOCIALS: Instagram edktrainingmn, Facebook EDKtrainingMN. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://www.edktraining.com/online-training. REVIEW FLAG: page identifies EDK Training LLC - a registered company rather than a sole individual, which sits outside your stated preference. FIT: session packs, programmes and digital downloads across three formats - subscriptions, digital products and messaging. OPENER: Session packs, a four-week programme and digital downloads is a product ladder already built - it just needs one place to sell from.', 'identified'),
  ('Ella Sklaw', 'substack', 'sklaw', 'https://sklaw.substack.com/', NULL, 'tattoo', NULL, 'csv', 72, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the Substack. AUDIENCE: over 3,000 subscribers stated on the page - inside your 1k-250k band. CREATES: Sklaw tattoo booking updates - the newsletter is the booking channel. PAID TIER: not shown. SOCIALS: not shown on the page. EMAIL: not published. LOCATION: not shown. FOLLOWERS: the 3,000+ figure is a SUBSCRIBER count, kept out of the followers column so social-follower data stays uncontaminated. SOURCE: https://sklaw.substack.com/. FIT: an owned list of 3,000 already used to open books - Spotlightly adds deposits and flash sales to an audience she controls. OPENER: Three thousand people waiting for your books to open is a queue, and queues are worth managing properly.', 'identified'),
  ('Izzy Gardner', 'substack', 'milkcrate.tattoo', 'https://milkcratetattoo.substack.com/', NULL, 'tattoo', NULL, 'csv', 66, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the Substack. Page names Izzy Gardner, trading as Milkcrate Tattoo. CREATES: newsletter carrying notifications for open books, last-minute availability, guest spots and FLASH DROPS - flash drops in particular are a product launch without a storefront. SUBSCRIBER COUNT: not shown. PAID TIER: not shown. SOCIALS: @milkcrate.tattoo. EMAIL: not published. LOCATION: not shown. ACTIVITY: page states the newsletter launched a year ago. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://milkcratetattoo.substack.com/. REVIEW FLAG: no audience size and no contact route - verify reach before prioritising. FIT: already runs flash drops to a list, which is a shop announcement with no shop behind it. OPENER: Announcing flash drops to a mailing list works right up until people want to actually buy one.', 'identified'),
  ('El (Blue Child Tattoo)', 'substack', 'bluechildtattoo', 'https://bluechildtattoo.substack.com/', NULL, 'tattoo', NULL, 'csv', 61, 'VERIFIED 2026-07-25 by fetching the Substack. Page names El. CREATES: tattoo bookings and offerings alongside personal writing on beauty, grief and reverence - a genuine writing practice rather than a bare booking list. ACTIVITY: page states the newsletter launched three years ago, so it is long-running. SUBSCRIBER COUNT: not shown. PAID TIER: not shown. SOCIALS: not shown. EMAIL: not published. LOCATION: not shown. FOLLOWERS: not published. SOURCE: https://bluechildtattoo.substack.com/. REVIEW FLAG: thin profile - no audience size, contact route or location. LOWER PRIORITY until identified. FIT: writing plus tattooing is exactly the paid-posts-plus-bookings combination Spotlightly handles. OPENER: Three years of writing alongside the bookings is an archive worth more than a mailing list gives it credit for.', 'identified')
